        "collapsible_tab_KVBdNK": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHY YOUR LABS CAN LOOK NORMAL",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>A standard blood panel measures glucose, not insulin. Your body can hold glucose in range for years by pumping out more insulin to do the same job. The number your doctor checks stays fine. The insulin behind it is never measured.</p><p>Estrogen helps your cells respond to insulin. As it drops through perimenopause, insulin resistance becomes more common. <strong>Normal glucose does not mean normal insulin.</strong></p><p>The tests that catch it: fasting insulin and HOMA-IR. Worth asking for.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "acc_line_color": "",
            "acc_text_color": "",
            "acc_title_case": "default"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_KhBe7c": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHAT BODOLOGY® INOSITOL SUPPORTS",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Inositol helps your cells respond to insulin, the signal behind cravings, afternoon crashes and weight that settles around your middle.</p><p>When taken consistently, inositol has been clinically studied to support:</p><ul><li>Insulin sensitivity and healthy blood sugar levels†</li><li>Metabolic function linked to appetite regulation and weight balance†</li><li>Sleep and energy regulation*</li><li>Neurotransmitter signaling linked to mood and emotional balance*</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "acc_line_color": "",
            "acc_text_color": "",
            "acc_title_case": "default"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Qq4nP6": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "WHAT WE LEAVE OUT",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<ul><li>No fillers, rice flour, binders, or additives</li><li>No artificial sweeteners or flavors</li><li>No added sugar</li><li>No gluten, dairy, or soy</li><li>No GMO ingredients</li><li>No hormones</li><li>No ingredients from animal origin</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "acc_line_color": "",
            "acc_text_color": "",
            "acc_title_case": "default"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_LHBcDr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW IT TASTES",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Naturally and gently sweet, with no added flavors.</p><p>Bodology® Inositol dissolves easily into water, smoothies, or coffee without grit or aftertaste, making daily consistency simple.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "acc_line_color": "",
            "acc_text_color": "",
            "acc_title_case": "default"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_w8UWx4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "HOW TO TAKE IT",
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Take <strong>2 scoops (4g) daily</strong>. That is the full dose used in the studies, in one serving.</p><p>Stir into your morning coffee, mix into water, or blend into a smoothie. It dissolves clear and tastes slightly sweet on its own.</p><p>Morning or evening both work. Consistency matters more than timing.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "acc_line_color": "",
            "acc_text_color": "",
            "acc_title_case": "default"
          }
        },
