    "why_inositol_DgbUrB": {
      "type": "why-inositol",
      "blocks": {
        "text_JCbbfq": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Why Bodology® inositol?</p><p>The full 4g dose the studies used.*</p>",
            "size": 30
          }
        },
        "text_cHr3qn": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In a six-month placebo-controlled study of 80 postmenopausal women with metabolic syndrome, 4g of myo-inositol a day (2g twice daily) alongside diet cut insulin resistance (HOMA index) by 75%.* Two scoops of Bodology is that same 4g, with 100mg D-chiro-inositol at the 40:1 ratio. Most capsules give you a fraction of it.</p>",
            "size": 0
          }
        },
        "accordion_Yfz7fg": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "WHAT'S INSIDE",
            "open": false,
            "chips": "4,000mg myo-inositol\n100mg D-chiro-inositol\n40:1 ratio\nNo fillers\nVegan\nGluten-free",
            "text": ""
          }
        },
        "stat_b6qWpy": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "value": "-75%",
            "text": "<p>insulin resistance (HOMA index) after 6 months on 4g a day, postmenopausal women*</p>"
          }
        },
        "stat_t4fBEx": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "value": "+80%",
            "text": "<p>improvement in whole-body insulin sensitivity*</p>"
          }
        },
        "stat_8HwQip": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "value": "2 in 5",
            "text": "<p>US adults have insulin resistance. Most don't know it*</p>"
          }
        },
        "stat_Aqd3H4": {
          "type": "stat",
          "settings": {
            "value": "4g",
            "text": "<p>the daily dose used in the studies. Two scoops of Bodology.</p>"
          }
        },
        "footer_Dk8jFD": {
          "type": "footer",
          "settings": {
            "position": "right",
            "text": "<p>*These statements have not been evaluated by the FDA. These studies did not use Bodology® Inositol specifically (postmenopausal study: Giordano et al., Menopause, 2011). This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
