          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "Waking up a lot less in the night",
            "text": "<p>After seeing reviews about better sleep and mood, I decided to try this powder even though I don't have PCOS. <strong>Since taking Bodology I'm waking up a lot less in the night, and falling asleep much easier.</strong> I'd also say I generally feel much calmer and focused for the whole day.</p>",
