            "text": "<p>I haven't had any clearly identifiable side effects, which I am thankful for. <strong>It has caused me to steadily lose weight over the five months I have used it so far.</strong> Given that I wasn't able to lose much on GLP-1s, this is a rather welcome effect that seems to be continuing.</p>",
